  lines:
  - "<?CamToBowley>And THAT\u2019S a wrap! [interact-button to progress dialogue]"
  - <?CamToCharon>Well that was disappointing.
  - "<?CamToBowley>While I\u2019d normally indulge you in the intricacies of cinematic
    story telling\u2026"
  - <?CamToBowley>That one was a let down
  - "<?CamToBowley>...I think I\u2019m done"
  - <?CamToBowley>Turnin in for da night?
  - <?CamToBowley>No, like forever
  - <?CamToBowley>WOAH WOAH WOAH
  - "<?CamToCharon>Also, there\u2019s no night here"
  - "<?CamToBowley>You\u2019d disappear I guess?"
  - "<?CamToBowley>WHAT\u2019S GOING TO HAPPEN TO ME?!"
  - "<?CamToCharon>I\u2019m just\u2026 tired"
  - <?CamToBowley>Charon, baby, surely we can work SOMETHING out right??
  - <?GoToLevel0> \n
